WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.767
♪♪

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.601
-And now, we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:07.567
When asked during an interview
last week

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.767
about the national mood,
President Biden said,

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:12.133
"People are
really, really down,"

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:15.601
even though he did everything
he could to make us smile.

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.834
After falling off his bike over
the weekend, President Biden

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:26.367
did a brief dance
after leaving church

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:28.534
to show reporters
he was feeling fine.

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.667
Though, just for the record,
we stopped associating dancing

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.033
with good health some time ago.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:39.367
Members of the House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:41.868
are reportedly considering
issuing a subpoena

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:43.701
to former Vice President
Mike Pence.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:47.501
Good luck. If those lips were
any tighter, they'd seal over.

00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:49.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:54.534
Sunday was Father's Day,
and what's nicer to hear

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:57.067
after "I love you"
than "Thanks"?

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.634
And ex-aide to
former President Trump

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:05.133
revealed in a new interview that
while watching President Biden

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:09.667
on TV, Trump blurted out, "Can
you believe I lost to this guy?"

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.033
"Been there," said one woman.

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:16.267
After last week's televised
hearings on the Capitol attack,

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:17.734
former President Trump
said on Friday

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:19.634
that ex-Vice President
Mike Pence

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:23.734
did not have the courage to act
on January 6th and added,

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.400
"Mike was afraid of
whatever he was afraid of."

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.133
Um, getting hanged?

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.968
You can't threaten to kill a man

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:33.200
and then ask
what he's so scared of.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:39.100
That's like Jason saying,
"What?! What did I do?"

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.300
According to a new report,

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.801
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.734
has fathered three children he
has not publicly acknowledged,

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:48.334
or, as his opponent thinks
of it, three more votes!

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.200
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:56.334
"The New York Times"
recently published an article

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.501
about so-called "peecyclers"

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:01.267
who recycle their urine
to use as fertilizer.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:02.834
I don't know.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:05.934
I think if that worked,
the subway would look like this.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:16.167
Today, June 21st,
is the longest day of the year.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:19.434
That's right -- One of my kids
has a piano recital.

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:21.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:26.100
An anonymous bidder
recently paid over $19 million

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.000
for a private lunch
in New York City

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.667
with up to seven guests
and investor Warren Buffett.

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:35.033
And I can guess what Buffett's
first investment tip will be.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.767
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.968
I guess I'm the only one
that can guess.

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:42.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.767
Not one of you
has the same guess as me?!

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:54.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:57.367
He's got -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:59.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:03.601
I mean, it's just, like, jarring

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.868
to go "oh" for the room.

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:07.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:10.734
He's gonna come in
and he's gonna be like,

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:12.901
"$19 million is too much
to pay for lunch."

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:18.801
[ Pencil snaps ]

00:03:18.801 --> 00:03:20.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:23.033
Ah-ah-ha! Ha-ha! Ha-ha!

00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:26.000
[ Applause ]

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.868
The toy company Nerf recently
unveiled its first-ever mascot,

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:31.567
which is a character
named Murph,

00:03:31.567 --> 00:03:34.834
though it's hard to imagine that
children will have the energy

00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:38.400
to play with Nerf products since
they will never sleep again!

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:42.567
In a new interview,
former vice president Mike Pence

00:03:42.567 --> 00:03:45.601
criticized President Biden
and said that he is

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:48.267
"embracing the politics
of the radical left."

00:03:48.267 --> 00:03:49.567
Are you kidding me?

00:03:49.567 --> 00:03:52.534
If anything, he falls
pretty hard to the right.

00:03:52.534 --> 00:03:54.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.601 --> 00:04:01.067
In the same interview,
former vice president Mike Pence

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:02.534
said that after
the Capitol attack,

00:04:02.534 --> 00:04:05.501
he talked through it
with former president Trump,

00:04:05.501 --> 00:04:07.667
and then they
"rolled our sleeves up

00:04:07.667 --> 00:04:09.033
and finished working together."

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:10.734
I don't buy it.

00:04:10.734 --> 00:04:13.334
The only way Trump ever
rolled his sleeves up

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:15.334
was to sell a fake Rolex.

00:04:15.334 --> 00:04:17.234
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:19.334
Pence also said in the interview
that he will

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:21.000
"always be proud to have served

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.667
alongside former
president Trump,"

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:26.133
because in the end,
there is no bond stronger

00:04:26.133 --> 00:04:27.801
than Stockholm syndrome.

00:04:27.801 --> 00:04:29.868
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:32.901
President Biden spent the day
yesterday at the beach.

00:04:32.901 --> 00:04:35.601
And when there was only one set
of footprints,

00:04:35.601 --> 00:04:37.300
that's when Jill carried him.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:40.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:43.901
Former president Trump said
in a new interview

00:04:43.901 --> 00:04:46.667
that he has not asked
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:04:46.667 --> 00:04:48.634
if he is running for president
in 2024

00:04:48.634 --> 00:04:51.901
but added that he thinks
he would win over DeSantis.

00:04:51.901 --> 00:04:53.934
Well, there's only one way
to find out --

00:04:53.934 --> 00:04:56.300
a long, nasty,
drawn-out primary season

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:57.767
where you two guys
are both emotionally

00:04:57.767 --> 00:04:59.133
and politically eviscerated,

00:04:59.133 --> 00:05:01.501
debating each other's last
brain cell into the ground,

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.968
destroying the Republican Party

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.467
and everything
you both stand for

00:05:04.467 --> 00:05:08.000
until there is only one husk of
a man left standing in the GOP

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.868
to actually run
in the election...

00:05:09.868 --> 00:05:11.033
Jeb!

00:05:11.033 --> 00:05:12.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:12.701 --> 00:05:14.334
There you go!

00:05:14.334 --> 00:05:19.400
A rare -- a rare
round of applause for Jeb.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.534
American Airlines has announced

00:05:25.534 --> 00:05:28.300
that it will no longer
service Toledo, Ohio,

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.534
due to a pilot shortage,

00:05:29.534 --> 00:05:31.334
despite being the only
commercial carrier

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:32.367
to service the city.

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:34.534
So if you have to go to Toledo,

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:36.801
I have even more bad news.

00:05:36.801 --> 00:05:38.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.634 --> 00:05:43.000
A man in the U.K.
said in a new interview

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.334
that he drank 30 cans of Pepsi
a day for 20 years

00:05:47.334 --> 00:05:50.434
but ended his addiction
after doing hypnotherapy.

00:05:50.434 --> 00:05:53.934
Man, that guy must have been
hard to hypnotize.

00:05:53.934 --> 00:05:55.667
"You're getting very sleepy."

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:57.834
"I'm really not!

00:05:57.834 --> 00:06:01.200
I'm really not, though.
I'm wide awake."

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.667
That's right, a man in the U.K.

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:07.133
said that he drank 30 cans
of Pepsi a day for 20 years.

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:12.167
Even crazier, another man in
the U.K. has had RC Cola twice.

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:14.000
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:18.868 --> 00:06:22.267
If there's any RC Cola fans
in Toledo watching tonight,

00:06:22.267 --> 00:06:24.567
it's a --

00:06:24.567 --> 00:06:26.734
Apologies.

00:06:26.734 --> 00:06:29.834
Today was actor
Jussie Smollett's 40th birthday.

00:06:29.834 --> 00:06:31.868
At least he says it is.

00:06:31.868 --> 00:06:34.734
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:06:34.734 --> 00:06:37.667
Move over, RC Cola joke.

00:06:37.667 --> 00:06:39.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.968
And finally,
according to new data,

00:06:43.968 --> 00:06:45.367
the price of a pound of lettuce

00:06:45.367 --> 00:06:47.968
has increased by more than 11%
in a year.

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:50.701
To give you an idea of what
a pound of lettuce looks like,

00:06:50.701 --> 00:06:52.067
order a Big Mac.

00:06:53.801 --> 00:06:57.534
President Biden spoke today
about rising gasoline prices,

00:06:57.534 --> 00:07:00.701
but just because alternative
means of transportation

00:07:00.701 --> 00:07:01.901
aren't working out.

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:06.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:06.834 --> 00:07:09.968
After President Biden fell off
his bike over the weekend,

00:07:09.968 --> 00:07:12.567
former President Trump
said he will,

00:07:12.567 --> 00:07:14.801
"Never, ever ride a bicycle."

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:18.934
Oh, nobody thought
you were going to.

00:07:18.934 --> 00:07:21.901
I mean, at least
until you said you weren't.

00:07:21.901 --> 00:07:25.000
Because if this is anything
like your past promises,

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.968
you'll be in the Tour de France
next month.

00:07:26.968 --> 00:07:28.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.834 --> 00:07:31.834
It did say Tour de France, Baze,
I apologize.

00:07:31.834 --> 00:07:34.601
I did it real fancy.

00:07:34.601 --> 00:07:36.200
Tour de "Frantz."

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.934
That's the Tour de France.

00:07:38.934 --> 00:07:40.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.767 --> 00:07:43.133
Tour of -- It's the tour of --

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:45.701
[ Laughter ]

00:07:45.701 --> 00:07:47.267
President Biden yesterday

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:50.267
signed two cybersecurity bills
into law.

00:07:50.267 --> 00:07:52.267
Said Biden, "Hang on.
It's almost done.

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:53.834
Says all I got to do now is

00:07:53.834 --> 00:07:57.067
enter my Social Security number
and mother's maiden name."

00:07:57.067 --> 00:07:59.300
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.667
President Biden today
asked Congress to approve

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:04.200
a three-month pause
on the federal gas tax

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.968
to help combat rising prices.

00:08:05.968 --> 00:08:07.834
And at this point,
he'll try anything.

00:08:07.834 --> 00:08:11.000
Don't be surprised if he starts
giving the price in liters.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.734
"Got it down to a buck 39!

00:08:14.734 --> 00:08:16.868
Nice."

00:08:16.868 --> 00:08:19.267
During yesterday's hearing
on the Capitol attack,

00:08:19.267 --> 00:08:20.701
committee members showed texts

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.968
that indicated Republican
Senator Ron Johnson

00:08:22.968 --> 00:08:25.934
wanted to hand-deliver
a list of fake electors

00:08:25.934 --> 00:08:27.567
for then
Vice President Mike Pence

00:08:27.567 --> 00:08:29.200
to introduce on January sixth.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.567
You sent that over text?

00:08:32.567 --> 00:08:35.501
Dude, how do you send bribes,
Venmo?

00:08:35.501 --> 00:08:38.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.567 --> 00:08:40.667
In a new interview,
Hillary Clinton said

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.567
that it would be
"out of the question"

00:08:42.567 --> 00:08:44.634
for her to run for
president in 2024.

00:08:44.634 --> 00:08:47.234
Oh, I wait. I read that wrong.
The interviewer said that.

00:08:47.234 --> 00:08:49.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:49.067 --> 00:08:53.367
The mayor of Moffat, Colorado,
which has 70 dispensaries

00:08:53.367 --> 00:08:55.567
but only 120 residents...

00:08:55.567 --> 00:08:57.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.467 --> 00:08:59.734
...said in a new interview
that she is considering

00:08:59.734 --> 00:09:02.667
changing the name of the town
to Kush.

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:05.133
Said residents, "Yeah, we know.

00:09:05.133 --> 00:09:07.767
You said the same thing
like 20 minutes ago."

00:09:07.767 --> 00:09:09.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.968 --> 00:09:12.067
Authorities in New York City
yesterday

00:09:12.067 --> 00:09:15.300
crushed nearly 100 illegal
dirt bikes with a bulldozer.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.701
And 6-year-olds don't know
how to feel about it.

00:09:18.701 --> 00:09:22.968
"I mean, I love dirt bikes,
but I also love bulldozers."

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:25.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:25.801 --> 00:09:28.667
That's my 6-year-old impression.
"Come on!"

00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:32.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:32.734 --> 00:09:34.467
Health officials in New Jersey
this week

00:09:34.467 --> 00:09:37.067
discovered their first
suspected case of monkeypox.

00:09:37.067 --> 00:09:39.067
And because it's Jersey,
you know

00:09:39.067 --> 00:09:41.601
that's going to be
that guy's nickname forever.

00:09:41.601 --> 00:09:44.167
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, oh, Monkeypox,

00:09:44.167 --> 00:09:45.567
we're getting beers.

00:09:45.567 --> 00:09:48.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.901
You're paying, Monkeypox."

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:54.767
[ Laughter ]

00:09:54.767 --> 00:09:57.534
And finally, the food company
Kraft announced today

00:09:57.534 --> 00:10:00.601
that it's changing the name of
its popular macaroni and cheese

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.901
to Mac and Cheese,

00:10:01.901 --> 00:10:04.100
while the people who eat it
for dinner every night

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.033
will still be known
as Kraft Singles.

00:10:06.033 --> 00:10:07.200
Aw, Goldich.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.834
[ Laughter ]

00:10:09.834 --> 00:10:11.667
Matthew Goldich, how...?

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:15.367
[ Laughter ]

00:10:15.367 --> 00:10:18.667
Oh, I feel like that guy
is going to meet somebody.

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:22.400
The FDA announced today
that it will ban the sale

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.334
of JUUL e-cigarettes.

00:10:24.334 --> 00:10:26.868
In related news,
some 15-year-olds

00:10:26.868 --> 00:10:31.033
just breached the Capitol.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:31.033 --> 00:10:33.434
The Supreme Court today issued
several rulings,

00:10:33.434 --> 00:10:36.601
including one that overturns a
New York state gun law

00:10:36.601 --> 00:10:38.167
restricting concealed weapons.

00:10:38.167 --> 00:10:39.868
So move over, tourists.

00:10:39.868 --> 00:10:42.467
Seriously, move over,
'cause you're gonna get shot.

00:10:42.467 --> 00:10:43.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:43.901 --> 00:10:47.868
That's right, the Supreme Court
overturned a New York law.

00:10:47.868 --> 00:10:50.334
A New York state gun law
restricting concealed weapons,

00:10:50.334 --> 00:10:53.167
'cause, you know, when sometimes
you'll be on the "F" train

00:10:53.167 --> 00:10:56.834
in August and there's no AC.,
and then it stops

00:10:56.834 --> 00:10:58.534
in the middle of the tunnel
and the conductor

00:10:58.534 --> 00:10:59.801
doesn't announce anything.

00:10:59.801 --> 00:11:04.400
And you think to yourself, "Man,
I wish we all had guns."

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:11.834
[ Laughter ]

00:11:11.834 --> 00:11:13.968
According to a new report,
the Biden administration

00:11:13.968 --> 00:11:17.968
got in touch with Tesla for
advice on electric car policy

00:11:17.968 --> 00:11:20.567
despite President Biden's public
feud with Elon Musk.

00:11:20.567 --> 00:11:22.801
Yeah, Biden's not afraid to
hash it out

00:11:22.801 --> 00:11:24.300
with someone
he disagrees with.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:27.501
He still thinks he can be
friends with Mitch McConnell.

00:11:27.501 --> 00:11:30.701
Hell, just yesterday,
he had lunch with that bike.

00:11:30.701 --> 00:11:37.400
[ Laughter ]

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.767
I wondered all day, "How does a
bike sit at a table?"

00:11:39.767 --> 00:11:44.434
And that's -- that's the best
possible way to do it.

00:11:44.434 --> 00:11:47.701
Media mogul Rupert Murdoch
is reportedly divorcing

00:11:47.701 --> 00:11:49.667
his fourth wife,
model Jerry Hall.

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:55.267
Wow. That's his fourth wife?
Who is his first wife, Eve?

00:11:55.267 --> 00:11:58.901
[ Laughter ]

00:11:58.901 --> 00:12:00.734
Former President Trump is
reportedly

00:12:00.734 --> 00:12:02.734
planning to visit Alaska
next month.

00:12:02.734 --> 00:12:05.968
So get ready for that
stream of consciousness.

00:12:05.968 --> 00:12:09.300
[ As Trump ] "It's so good to be
in Alaska, which is not

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.200
connected to the other states.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.934
Many people don't --
many people don't know that.

00:12:13.934 --> 00:12:16.467
Very, very unfair of the
mainland.

00:12:16.467 --> 00:12:19.300
The way they treat Alaska is
very unfair.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:23.267
It's very -- home of Juneau.
Juneau.

00:12:23.267 --> 00:12:26.334
That wacky high school girl who
got pregnant."

00:12:26.334 --> 00:12:28.701
[ Laughter ]
"She said silly words.

00:12:28.701 --> 00:12:31.501
She talks in a very --
A very silly way, Juneau.

00:12:31.501 --> 00:12:34.767
We love Juneau.
We love --

00:12:34.767 --> 00:12:37.200
And that, my friends, is
everything I know about you.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.868
[ Laughter ]

00:12:39.868 --> 00:12:41.734
[ Normal voice ] The makers of
Monopoly yesterday

00:12:41.734 --> 00:12:44.467
released a Hamptons Edition of
the board game.

00:12:44.467 --> 00:12:47.267
Said residents,
"What the hell is income tax?"

00:12:47.267 --> 00:12:52.267
[ Laughter ]

00:12:52.267 --> 00:12:55.501
Authorities in Oklahoma arrested
an employee at a fast-food

00:12:55.501 --> 00:12:57.534
restaurant this week
after a customer found

00:12:57.534 --> 00:13:00.767
a small bag of
crystal meth with their order,

00:13:00.767 --> 00:13:03.734
when they had clearly ordered
a large!

00:13:03.734 --> 00:13:07.534
[ Laughter ]

00:13:07.534 --> 00:13:10.601
The U.S. Patent and Trademark
Office officially approved

00:13:10.601 --> 00:13:13.868
a request yesterday for
Ohio State University

00:13:13.868 --> 00:13:17.300
to register the word "the" in an
attempt to get

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.067
your dad to stop calling it
"The Facebook."

00:13:20.067 --> 00:13:22.400
[ Laughter ]

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.868
Finally, tomorrow is national
"Take your dog to work day,"

00:13:24.868 --> 00:13:26.400
while for people
who work from home,

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:30.234
it's national
Work Around Your Cat Day.

00:13:30.234 --> 00:13:32.968
And that, you guys,
was a monologue, everybody!

00:13:32.968 --> 00:13:37.634
♪♪

